 Self-hosted AI agent stack. Provisioned by Terraform.

 Layout:
   ~/agent/                      <- compose root
     docker-compose.yml
     .env                        <- generated secrets; edit API keys only
     backup.sh                   <- runs nightly via cron
     postgres/init/              <- first-boot SQL (pgvector + DBs)

 Useful:
   cd ~/agent && docker compose ps
   cd ~/agent && docker compose up -d
   cd ~/agent && docker compose logs -f <service>
   docker exec -it agent-postgres psql -U agent
   docker exec -it agent-ollama ollama list

 Next, follow the main guide sections 7-11 to add:
   Open WebUI, n8n, Langfuse, Caddy reverse proxy, MCP gateway.

 You are on the Tailnet as:  agent-vm
 Backups go to:              gs://<project>-agent-backups-01
 Snapshots (disk-level):     daily @ 07:00 UTC, 14-day retention

